[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238363\">5050B28</a></p><p>1. Lift the bonnet lid and move the  nut cover.</p><p>2. Unscrew the nut.</p><p>3. Remove the wiper arm.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018601.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the wiper arm is\nnot damaged.</p><p>Reassemble the wiper arm fastening the\nnut.</p><p>Place the nut cover.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238363\">5050B28</a></p><p>Check the regular function of the windscreen\nwiper.</p>"]]